Shortcut	What it does
Ctrl + B	Bold
Ctrl + I	Italic
Ctrl + U	Underline
Ctrl + 1	⭐ Open Format Cells
Ctrl + Shift + $	Currency format
Ctrl + Shift + %	Percentage format
Ctrl + Shift + #	Date format
Ctrl + Shift + !	Number format with commas + 2 decimals
Ctrl + Shift + ~	General number format
Ctrl + 5	Strikethrough
Alt + H, H	Fill/background colour
Alt + H, FC	Font colour
Alt + H, B	Borders menu
Alt + H, A, C	Center align
Alt + H, A, L	Left align
Alt + H, A, R	Right align
Alt + H, W	Wrap Text
Alt + H, O, I	⭐ AutoFit column width
Alt + H, O, A	AutoFit row height
Ctrl + T	⭐ Turn selected data into an Excel Table
Ctrl + Space	Select entire column
Shift + Space	Select entire row
